"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">16</div><h1>2격과 n-변화 명사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Der Genitiv und die n-Deklination</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 16의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">2격 관사와 명사 어미 -s·-es를 바르게 붙여요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">사람 이름의 2격과 von + 3격으로 '~의'를 말해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">wegen·trotz·während·statt·innerhalb·außerhalb 뒤에 2격을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">n-변화 명사를 알아보고 1격 밖의 자리에서 -(e)n을 붙여요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Kurz vor dem Anfang <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Konzerts ist der Strom ausgefallen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) des</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">das Konzert(중성)의 2격 관사는 des예요.<br>명사에도 -s가 붙어서 des Konzerts예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Im Herbst ist die Farbe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Blätter besonders schön.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) des</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">복수 2격 관사는 der예요.<br>복수 명사에는 2격 어미를 붙이지 않아요 — der Blätter.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;meiner&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Das ist das Fahrrad <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mein- · Nachbarin · 여성)</span> Nachbarin. Sie fährt jeden Tag damit zur Arbeit.</div><div class=\"qko\">이건 우리 이웃집 아주머니의 자전거예요. 그분은 매일 그걸 타고 출근해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist das Fahrrad <b>meiner</b> Nachbarin. Sie fährt jeden Tag damit zur Arbeit.</div>여성 2격 소유관사는 meiner예요.<br>여성 명사 Nachbarin에는 2격 어미를 붙이지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wohnzimmers&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Die Fenster des <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Wohnzimmer · 중성)</span> sind seit Wochen schmutzig.</div><div class=\"qko\">거실 창문들이 몇 주째 더러워요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Fenster des <b>Wohnzimmers</b> sind seit Wochen schmutzig.</div>중성 2격은 des + 명사 -s예요.<br>2음절 이상인 명사는 -s만 붙여요 — des Wohnzimmers.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Tickets&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Den Preis des <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Ticket · 중성)</span> finden Sie auf der Webseite.</div><div class=\"qko\">티켓 가격은 웹사이트에서 확인하실 수 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Den Preis des <b>Tickets</b> finden Sie auf der Webseite.</div>중성 2격은 명사 끝에 -s를 붙여요 — des Tickets.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Schlosses&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Die Mauern des <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Schloss · 중성)</span> sind über 800 Jahre alt.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 성의 성벽은 800년이 넘었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Mauern des <b>Schlosses</b> sind über 800 Jahre alt.</div>-s·-ß·-x·-z로 끝나는 명사는 2격에서 반드시 -es를 붙여요 — des Schlosses.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> '카롤리나의 노트북'을 바르게 쓴 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Karolinas Laptop</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) der Laptop Karolinas'</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Karolinas' Laptop</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Karolina's Laptop</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사람 이름은 -s를 붙여 명사 앞에 놓아요.<br>영어처럼 아포스트로피를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> '펠릭스의 어머니'를 바르게 쓴 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Felix's Mutter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Felixs Mutter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Felix' Mutter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Felixes Mutter</button></div><div class=\"qe\">이름이 -x로 끝나면 -s를 붙이지 않고 아포스트로피만 써요 — Felix' Mutter.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;deinem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Ist das die Jacke von <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(dein- · Bruder · 남성)</span> Bruder? Sie liegt schon seit Montag hier.</div><div class=\"qko\">이거 네 형 재킷이야? 월요일부터 여기 놓여 있어.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ist das die Jacke von <b>deinem</b> Bruder? Sie liegt schon seit Montag hier.</div>말할 때는 2격 대신 von + 3격을 자주 써요.<br>남성 3격 → von deinem Bruder.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> eines Unfalls stehen viele Autos auf der Autobahn.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Statt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Während</button></div><div class=\"qe\">사고가 차가 막힌 이유라서 wegen(~ 때문에)이에요.<br>wegen + 2격 → wegen eines Unfalls.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Trotz&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(~에도 불구하고)</span> der Kälte gehen die Kinder im See schwimmen.</div><div class=\"qko\">추운데도 아이들은 호수에 수영하러 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Trotz</b> der Kälte gehen die Kinder im See schwimmen.</div>'~에도 불구하고'는 trotz + 2격이에요 — trotz der Kälte.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Die Jugendherberge liegt <span class=\"qblank\"></span> des Dorfes, mitten im Wald.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) außerhalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) wegen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) innerhalb</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) statt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">숲 한가운데라서 마을 밖이에요 — außerhalb + 2격 → außerhalb des Dorfes.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Koffer steht noch im Flur? — Das ist der Koffer meiner Tante.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Wessen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'누구의?'를 묻는 의문사는 wessen이고, 바로 뒤에 명사가 와요 — Wessen Koffer?</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Kennst du <span class=\"qblank\"></span>? Er schreibt für eine Zeitung in Hamburg. (그 남자 기자)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) den Journalisten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) der Journalist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) den Journalist</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dem Journalisten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">kennen은 4격 목적어를 받아요.<br>Journalist는 -ist로 끝나는 n-변화 명사라서 4격에서 -en이 붙어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dem&quot;],[&quot;Affen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Im Zoo gibt die Pflegerin <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(정관사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Affe · 남성)</span> eine Banane.</div><div class=\"qko\">동물원에서 사육사가 원숭이에게 바나나를 하나 줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im Zoo gibt die Pflegerin <b>dem</b> <b>Affen</b> eine Banane.</div>받는 쪽은 3격이에요 — dem.<br>Affe는 -e로 끝나는 남성 동물이라서 n-변화 → dem Affen.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;],[&quot;Jungen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Die Ärztin untersucht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(정관사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\